# Trivy ignore list. CVEs listed here do NOT fail the CI security gate.
#
# Policy: keep this empty whenever possible. An entry is only allowed when
#   1. no fixed version exists upstream, or the vulnerable code path is not
#      reachable in this service (explain which), and
#   2. it carries an expiry date so it is re-reviewed, e.g.
#        CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31   # reason, owner
